/*
Problem: Check if All A's Appears Before All B's (LC 2124)
Topic: String

--------------------------------------------------

Idea:

The string is valid if no 'b' appears
before an 'a'.

This is equivalent to saying the
substring "ba" should never occur.

Use the built-in find() function:

• If "ba" is found, return false.

• Otherwise, return true.

--------------------------------------------------

Time: O(n)

Space: O(1)

--------------------------------------------------
*/

class Solution {
public:
    bool checkString(string s) {

        if(s.find("ba") != string::npos)
            return false;

        return true;
    }
};
